---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../consts";

const updated = "26 August 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & conditions"
  description="Terms for using Cluetune, the free browser game where you guess the song from a short clip."
>
  <article class="page-shell py-8 sm:py-16">
    <header class="flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-3">
      <p class="eyebrow">Terms & conditions</p>
      <h1 class="text-display-xl text-ink">Terms & conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Last updated {updated}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-12 flex max-w-prose flex-col gap-8 text-body-md text-body">
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Using Cluetune</h2>
        <p>
          By opening {SITE.domain} you agree to these terms. Cluetune is a free, no-account game.
          We may change modes, catalogues or these terms; the date above is the current version.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">The game, not a streaming service</h2>
        <p>
          Cluetune lets you guess a song from a short licensed preview or a lyric snippet. It is not
          a substitute for Spotify, Apple Music or YouTube. Full tracks, downloads and offline
          playback are not offered. Previews play from the rights holders’ own services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Your conduct</h2>
        <p>
          Don’t abuse the APIs behind the game, scrape the catalogue at scale, or use the site to
          distribute malware. Challenge links share a round identifier — don’t use them to harass
          anyone. Stats on this device are yours to export or delete.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Availability</h2>
        <p>
          The site is provided as-is. A provider outage (previews, lyrics, charts) can skip a track
          or delay a round. We are not liable for lost streaks, downtime, or guesses that did not
          feel fair. The matching rules are described on{" "}
          <a href="/how-to-play" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">How to play</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Cluetune’s name, layout and original copy are ours. Song titles, artwork, lyrics and
          recordings belong to their respective owners. Lyric snippets are shown only as a short
          clue in Lyrics Guess.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-display-sm text-ink">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms:{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">{SITE.email}</a>
          {" "}·{" "}
          <a href="/privacy" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">Privacy policy</a>
          {" "}·{" "}
          <a href="/about" class="text-link underline underline-offset-4">About us</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
